<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-10-22T01:40:26.440Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 01:40:26 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent incidents continue in the southern insurgency zone, with pipe bombs wounding army officers and security volunteers in Narathiwat and Yala and grenade attacks in Trang, while Thai security forces killed suspected drug couriers and seized half a tonne of ice in Phetchaburi. Chinese nationals were arrested after crossing into Thailand from Laos and a Thai driver and a Lao man were detained for aiding Chinese border crossers, and the Thai Army proposed sending cadets to China for training. Cambodia’s Hun Manet set conditions for border talks with former opposition leader Um Sam An, while Thailand’s prime minister set conditions for evidence talks with Um Sam An, and the Thai foreign minister urged China to keep tourist warnings proportionate. The WTO and multilateral partners reviewed progress on a supply-chain finance initiative, and there were 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/trfin_16oct26_517_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNOVplVDRnMHJIUUpYQ1I3TjV4QXJLN3RodnhTS2EybngtWFo0VEZ2RDlqcm9lTURHTmlJTHFOWmYtWmlWX0RWMzlzMWZOQUxzbGdRWjM1bnh4UGtrc3ZGdVZhY3VWWEhoYjFMUWRGYU1rTW1yNlZJbWV0cFZsX1g5MU0zYVpYZ2lQcDZvSUZka2taS0UyeUZHZ1djeDFRNXczSlhKTlhuZmRIQXJsU2xRLQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Pattaya Mail&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxQNUNHRWxxeDFSSVdrT3RwN3RPdG50ekVDczVKZkRrdC1PVF9Edm9BNDc4R1dPWGI0b1oxUTBBX3J3YjFvaUZ1dWFaNGctR1NBdXVmMmtGSFA4aGNSTmR3RkJpeGhlVHNGRU1TN2g3Zy1UNmdOVGFXSHhDV1Y3YXRxRnZhR3hYU0dNQy05YXI4UWg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxNOWVRWGJ2SVVYRlZGSVNZazNQWmFILXRaclNlYVdOcFUzX0wyTHBaTW5YdF9sNDVkS2V1YU1zWkpoRUFFWkphS2xVT0RHNTFx